lavaland-lazarus-empty = The injector is empty.
lavaland-lazarus-malfunction = The injector's display flickers.
lavaland-lazarus-invalid = The injector won't work on this creature.
lavaland-lazarus-not-dead = It's still alive.
lavaland-lazarus-revived = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } injects { THE($target) } with the lazarus injector, and it comes back to life!

lavaland-minebot-collecting = The minebot is collecting ore.
lavaland-minebot-not-collecting = The minebot is not collecting ore.
lavaland-minebot-bind = Bind to yourself
lavaland-minebot-collect-on = Enable ore collection
lavaland-minebot-collect-off = Disable ore collection
lavaland-minebot-bound = The minebot now follows you.
lavaland-minebot-unloaded = The minebot unloads its ore.
lavaland-minebot-unload-verb = Unload ore

lavaland-wisp-lantern-release = You release the wisp. It begins to bob around your head.
lavaland-wisp-lantern-return = You return the wisp to the lantern.
lavaland-warp-cube-fizzle = The cube fizzles uselessly.
lavaland-talisman-not-ready = The talisman is not ready yet.
lavaland-talisman-vanish = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } vanishes from reality, leaving a hole in their place!
lavaland-talisman-return = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } pops back into reality!
lavaland-ship-bottle-empty = The bottle is empty, the boat is outside.
lavaland-ship-bottle-release = You release the boat from the bottle.
lavaland-ship-bottle-return = The boat returns into the bottle.
lavaland-potion-nothing = You feel nothing but a terrible aftertaste.
lavaland-flight-potion-drink = A little white cloud gathers and thickens under your feet. Chasms and lava no longer scare you.

lavaland-asclepius-unworthy = The snake carving comes alive for a moment, but seems to find you incapable of holding its oath.
lavaland-asclepius-already = You can't possibly handle the responsibility of more than one rod!
lavaland-asclepius-start = The carved snake comes alive and slithers down your arm. Stand still while swearing the oath.
lavaland-asclepius-interrupted = The snake is unsatisfied with your incomplete oath and returns to the rod.
lavaland-asclepius-bound = The snake binds the rod to your arm with an inseparable grip. Harm is now nothing more than a distant memory...
lavaland-asclepius-oath-1 = I swear to fulfill, to the best of my ability and judgment, this covenant:
lavaland-asclepius-oath-2 = I will apply, for the benefit of the sick, all measures that are required, avoiding overtreatment and therapeutic nihilism.
lavaland-asclepius-oath-3 = I will remember that I remain a member of society, with special obligations to all my fellow beings, the sound and the infirm.
lavaland-asclepius-oath-4 = If I do not violate this oath, may I enjoy life, respected while I live, and long experience the joy of healing those who seek my help.

lavaland-memento-draining = You feel your life being drained by the pendant...
lavaland-memento-linked = Your life is now linked to the pendant. While you wear it you won't die, but removing it would kill you.
lavaland-memento-mori = Life rapidly slips away from { THE($user) }!

lavaland-berserker-charge = Berserk charge: { $charge }%.
lavaland-berserker-not-charged = The armour has not gathered enough rage yet.
lavaland-berserker-charged = The berserker armour is fully charged!
lavaland-berserker-on = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) } flies into a berserker rage!
lavaland-berserker-off = { CAPITALIZE(THE($user)) }'s rage fades.
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-title = Beacon message
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-prompt = You leave on the marker:
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-set = You scratch a message onto the beacon.
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-cleared = You scratch the message off the beacon.
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-examine = Scratched on the beacon: [color=yellow]{ $message }[/color]
lavaland-marker-beacon-message-hint = A screwdriver can scratch a message onto the beacon.

lavaland-tamed-order-follow = Your tamed creatures follow you.
lavaland-tamed-order-stay = Your tamed creatures stay put.
lavaland-tamed-order-attack = Your tamed creatures join the fight! Point at a target and they will go for it.
lavaland-tamed-emp = { CAPITALIZE(THE($target)) } twitches - the nanomachines fail, it is wild again!
lavaland-warp-cube-not-lavaland = The cube only works on Lavaland or in the caves, with its twin in the same place.
lavaland-mad-miner-risen-name = necromorph miner
lavaland-mad-miner-risen = { CAPITALIZE(THE($miner)) } jerks back up - claws burst from its hands!
lavaland-lazarus-too-strong = The nanomachines are powerless - this creature is far too mighty.
lavaland-geist-ambush-shot = The geist flinches and drops back into its hole!
lavaland-boss-execute-start = { CAPITALIZE(THE($boss)) } senses the death clinging to { THE($target) } and comes to claim it!
lavaland-boss-execute = { CAPITALIZE(THE($boss)) } tears { THE($target) } apart - the memento mori holds no longer!
